    H=T^4 + T^2*S^2 + S^4   eps_d (d<=k)={2: 1, 3: 1, 4: 0}   ずれ指数 delta=-1   Delta=8
    ord_2(kappa_n) n=0..5 = [0, 8, 40, 86, 180, 370]   (0.5s)
      n=0 実測=0      N2予言=8        NG!   N1予言(Delta=0)=0        OK 
      n=1 実測=8      N2予言=18       NG!   N1予言(Delta=0)=10       NG 
